<title>GREECE: Greek warrant prices suspended on mkt upset - ING.</title>
<headline>Greek warrant prices suspended on mkt upset - ING.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Baring Financial Products suspended prices on Greek warrants on Thursday because of a market disruption event, it said.</p>
<p>ING Barings has issued American-style call warrants on a basket of Greek blue-chips and a basket of six bank stocks.</p>
<p>Market watchers said lack of liquidity and therefore inability to hedge was behind the suspension of prices.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
